  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local Network AMEA Professionalization of Farmers&#x2019;  Organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">It is a project of two years to support a network of different public and private organizations in Benin involved in strengthening and professionalizing farmers&#x2019; organizations. It will be a local platform of AMEA (Agribusiness Market Ecosystem Alliance) to define standards for cooperatives, support exchange of methodologies and support services to improve the enabling environment for good functioning cooperatives.</narrative>
  </description>
